cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this material, please cite it as below."
title: "Problemi di ottimizzazione combinatoria: online lecture notes with worked exercises"
abstract: >-
  The lecture notes (in Italian) of the course Problemi di ottimizzazione combinatoria
  (Combinatorial Optimization Problems): knapsack, packing, vertex coloring, maximum
  clique, routing, parallel machine scheduling and lot sizing problems, their integer
  linear programming formulations with their properties and bounds, and ad hoc
  branch-and-bound algorithms, with definitions, propositions and proofs, worked
  examples, a catalogue of the problems, exercises with solutions, slides and
  interactive apps.
